{"product_id":"the-boy-who-steals-houses","title":"The Boy Who Steals Houses","description":"\u003cp\u003eCan two broken boys find their perfect home? By turns heartbreaking and heartwarming, this is a gorgeously told, powerful story.Sam is only fifteen but he and his autistic older brother, Avery, have been abandoned by every relative he's ever known. Now Sam's trying to build a new life for them. He survives by breaking into empty houses when their owners are away, until one day he's caught out when a family returns home. To his amazement this large, chaotic family takes him under their wing - each teenager assuming Sam is a friend of another sibling. Sam finds himself inextricably caught up in their life, and falling for the beautiful Moxie.But Sam has a secret, and his past is about to catch up with him.Heartfelt storytelling, perfect for fans of Jandy Nelson and Jennifer Niven.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Drews\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781408349922\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 368\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45807533228185,"sku":"17RB-19781408349922","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f5c1dddbb8f_The_Boy_Who_Steals_Houses_Drews.jpg?v=1760971815","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-boy-who-steals-houses","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}